# Deelbaar — monorepo (pnpm workspaces)

## Layout
- **`apps/mobile`**: Expo app (router entry, `app/`, `lib/`, `android/`, `eas.json`, `app.json`).
- **`apps/cms`**: Payload CMS + Next (`@deelbaar/cms`); dev server default port **4000**.
- **Root**: `pnpm-workspace.yaml`, `pnpm copy:payload-types` → `scripts/sync-payload-types.cjs` (copies `apps/cms/src/payload-types.ts` → `apps/mobile/lib/types/payload-generated.ts`).
- **Dev both**: `pnpm dev` runs `concurrently` — Payload/Next on **:4000** (`dev:cms`) + Expo dev client (`dev:mobile`), after `copy:payload-types`. Same idea as `de-aandachtgevers` (`FND,BCK`).
- Run mobile only: `pnpm dev:mobile` or `pnpm start` (sync + Metro). CMS only: `pnpm dev:cms`. Native: `pnpm android` / `pnpm ios`.

## Stack (mobile)
- **Expo SDK**: ~55 (dev client: `expo-dev-client`)
- **React Native**: 0.83.x | **React**: 19.2.x
- **Navigation**: `expo-router` (file-based app router; entry `expo-router/entry`)
- **UI**: Tamagui v2 rc (`@tamagui/*`, `tamagui.config.ts`)
- **Data**: TanStack React Query v5
- **Backend**: Payload CMS via `lib/api/PayloadClient`; generated types synced with `pnpm copy:payload-types` (also run at the start of `pnpm start`)
- **Maps**: `@rnmapbox/maps` (Expo plugin in `apps/mobile/app.json`)
- **On-device / vision**: `@react-native-ml-kit/text-recognition`; image/analysis helpers under `lib/ai/`
- **Build**: EAS project id in `apps/mobile/app.json` → `expo.extra.eas`; `pnpm eas` = local Android EAS build
- **Package manager**: pnpm 10

## Conventions for the agent
- Prefer **Expo-compatible** APIs; use `npx expo install <pkg>` when adding or upgrading native-related packages so versions match the SDK.
- Match existing patterns: Tamagui styling, expo-router layouts and modals under `apps/mobile/app/`.
- Do not commit secrets; new mobile config keys belong in `apps/mobile/env-example.txt` and `apps/mobile/.env` (Expo loads env from the app root, not the monorepo root). CMS secrets stay in `apps/cms/.env`.
- Run **lint** after substantive edits: `pnpm lint` (ESLint universe/native + Prettier).

## Skills
- Project skills live under `.cursor/skills/` (e.g. Callstack **agent-skills** at `.cursor/skills/agent-skills`). Use `/` in Agent chat to pick skills by name when relevant.
